.title = "EuroZig e.V. Founding Meeting in Munich",
.date = .date("2026-07-10T00:00:00"),
.description = "The founding meeting of EuroZig e.V. will take place in Munich.",
.layout = "post.shtml",
---

We are happy to announce that the founding meeting of EuroZig e.V. will take
place in Munich on Sunday, September 13, 10:00 at Schlungsräume von PixelComputer e.K. in Munich.
More information can be found on the [events page]($link.page('events/zigtoberfest-2026')).
